stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "未发起（原有单据）" as not_started
  state "预审中" as prechecking
  state "AI 初审中" as ai_running
  state "AI 初审失败" as ai_failed
  state "待人工复核" as pending_review
  state "已通过" as approved
  state "已退回" as returned
  state "已失效" as invalidated
  [*] --> prechecking: 来单，系统自动发起
  [*] --> not_started
  not_started --> prechecking: 有人点「发起 AI 初审」
  invalidated --> prechecking: 重新发起
  prechecking --> ai_running: 九安预审完成
  prechecking --> ai_failed: 预审未完成
  ai_running --> pending_review: AI 初审建议返回
  ai_running --> ai_failed: 初审未完成
  ai_failed --> ai_running: 系统自动重试一次 / 人点重试
  ai_failed --> pending_review: 人工复核（不带 AI 建议）
  pending_review --> approved: 人工复核：通过
  pending_review --> returned: 人工复核：退回
  pending_review --> invalidated: 单据版本变化
  approved --> [*]
  returned --> [*]
  note right of pending_review
    AI 只给初审建议，结论由人做；
    与建议相反时必须写理由
  end note
  class approved good
  class returned risk
  class ai_failed warn
  class invalidated pocOnly
